@ECHO OFF
ECHO Welcome to C4DOS, the Build Ladder
VER
PATH \BUILD;\GRIN;\BIN
REM C4KE and C4IX find their files, and the games, through APPEND
APPEND \BUILD;\C4KE;\C4IX;\GRIN;\BIN;\GAMES\ACE;\GAMES\ADVENT;\GAMES\BSDGAMES;\GAMES\DOOM;\GAMES\DUKE3D;\GAMES\FROTZ;\GAMES\PDCURSES;\GAMES\PUZZLES;\GAMES\QUAKE;\GAMES\ROTT;\GAMES\TYRIAN;\GAMES\WOLF3D
ECHO The games, in \GAMES: SOLITAIRE, FREECELL, ADVENT, FISH, WUMP, PIG, QUIZ, ADVENTUR, BACKGAMM, TREK, MONOP, HANGMAN, RAIN, WORM, GOMOKU, SNAKE, CANFLD, ROBOTS, TETRIS, CRIBBAGE, MILLE, BOGGLE, BATTLEST, ATC, SAIL, DOOM, DUKE3D, FROTZ, FIREWORK, XMAS, TESTCURS, NET, FIFTEEN, MINES, QUAKE, ROTT, TYRIAN, WOLF3D.
ECHO GRIN starts the graphical shell.
ECHO Climb: BUILD, then RUN dosload.c4r c4ke.c4r boots the kernel it built.
ECHO TYPE LADDER.TXT says every step, up to C4IX.
